          <AbstractText Label="BACKGROUND" NlmCategory="BACKGROUND">Few trials compare curl variants.</AbstractText>
          <AbstractText Label="METHODS" NlmCategory="METHODS">Twenty-four trained men trained for 8 weeks.</AbstractText>
          <AbstractText Label="RESULTS" NlmCategory="RESULTS">Muscle thickness rose 1.2 mm<sup>2</sup> in both groups (<i>p</i> = 0.71).</AbstractText>
